  "description": "What she once believed to be a picture-perfect marriage comes to a crashing halt after just three years. Devastated by her divorce from her ex-husband Kangin, Jimin retreats to her peaceful rural hometown, desperate to escape her painful past. However, her quiet haven is quickly upended when she meets Jihyeok, the irresistibly handsome younger man living next door. \n\nJimin's original plan was simple: abandon her urban troubles and enjoy a serene, secluded life. Instead, she finds herself caught between two completely different forces of nature—a sweet, younger neighbor who unreservedly pours his pure devotion into her, and the impeccably refined ex-husband she once deeply loved. As both men fiercely vie for her heart, Jimin's resolve begins to waver. At the end of this stormy emotional upheaval, which relationship will finally bloom into true happiness?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
